{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15106770","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15106770","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1510677001:1":{"text":"A key rests inside the wooden box. The smooth and lustrous feel of the polished brass tells you it was clearly made by Tully.","source_cn":"木匣中躺着一把钥匙。黄铜抛光的温润手感，明显也是出自塔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23F8B4980D979491","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:0::2":{"text":"Key","source_cn":"钥匙","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1AAC35C9ABEE127","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1510677002:1":{"text":"You've found the key, but you still don't know which door it opens.","source_cn":"你已经找到了钥匙，但仍然不知道钥匙应打开哪扇门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF50A60F580499F88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510677003:1":{"text":"We just need to find where Tully hid the light source now.","source_cn":"接下来，我们只需要找到塔利藏匿光源的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8665A93854E373F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510677004:1":{"text":"But that's the problem. You don't know where he hid it.","source_cn":"问题来了。光源在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC92359F0AF59F0D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1510677004":{"text":"But that's the problem. You don't know where he hid it.","source_cn":"问题来了。光源在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC92359F0AF59F0D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510677005:0":{"text":"If the light source is a physical object, you can't just put it in a heart.","source_cn":"如果光源是一个具象的物体，那就不可能放到心里去。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCDD7B579987D7745","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"If the light source is a physical object, you can't just put it in a heart.","female":"If the light source is a physical object, you can't just put it in a heart.","variant_male_record_index":"176428","variant_female_record_index":"176429","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510677006:0":{"text":"Unless... he was talking about a dead person.","source_cn":"噢，除非他说的是死人。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x15EEC9542BF932A0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Unless... he was talking about a dead person.","female":"Unless... he was talking about a dead person.","variant_male_record_index":"176430","variant_female_record_index":"176431","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510677007:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">In the heart</style>...","source_cn":"<style=highlight>在心里</style>……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1061E0F22A40A47C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510677008:0":{"text":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, does Sedecim have a heart?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1120027FD5511D01","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, does Sedecim have a heart?","female":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, does Sedecim have a heart?","variant_male_record_index":"176433","variant_female_record_index":"176434","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1510677008":{"text":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, does Sedecim have a heart?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>大人，十六有心吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1120027FD5511D01","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, does Sedecim have a heart?","female":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, does Sedecim have a heart?","variant_male_record_index":"176433","variant_female_record_index":"176434","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510677009:1":{"text":"No, look. According to Sedecim's design plans, <style=\"highlight\">his chest is hollow</style>.","source_cn":"不，您看。十六的设计稿上，<style=highlig...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x253B5DDE83946FAA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"No, look. According to Sedecim's design plans, <style=\"highlight\">his chest is hollow</style>.","female":"No, look. According to Sedecim's design plans, <style=\"highlight\">his chest is hollow</style>.","variant_male_record_index":"176435","variant_female_record_index":"176436","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:13::2":{"text":"Puppet Designs","source_cn":"木人设计稿","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A80A5640D1ECBB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510677010:0":{"text":"Oh, so it is.","source_cn":"噢，还真是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13770331C2C0378F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510677011:1":{"text":"But would he really put something so important inside a puppet that just wanders around? If so, he might be even crazier than the God of Harvest.","source_cn":"不过，他会把那么重要的东西放在随便乱跑的木偶身上吗？如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AE823F53A2FE977","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510677012:1":{"text":"Sedecim once said that Tully told him to keep an <style=\"highlight\">important mission</style>... in his heart.","source_cn":"十六曾经说过，塔利让它把<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40E190D59F4686DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:18::0":{"text":"Puppet Designs","source_cn":"木人设计稿","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A80A5640D1ECBB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510677013:0":{"text":"You pore over the design drawings. Gala and Merlin were right. Sedecim is a hollow puppet, capable of storing objects of a specific size within its torso.","source_cn":"你仔细端详设计稿，加拉和梅林说的有道理，十六是一具中空...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6D908AF4F316712","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510677014:0":{"text":"In fact, you recall seeing a similar design thousands of years in the future, in an abandoned manor in the Duchy of Whiteridge. This makes the answer almost obvious.","source_cn":"其实，在万年后的白山公国，某个废弃的庄园里，你曾见过类...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x997DA4A1B067F24F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1510677014":{"text":"In fact, you recall seeing a similar design thousands of years in the future, in an abandoned manor in the Duchy of Whiteridge. This makes the answer almost obvious.","source_cn":"其实，在万年后的白山公国，某个废弃的庄园里，你曾见过类似的设计。这让你几乎毫不犹豫地做出判断。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x997DA4A1B067F24F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1510677015:0":{"text":"I... remember now.","source_cn":"十六……十六想起来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x049C90064332DC2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1510677016:0":{"text":"Inside me... there is something.","source_cn":"十六心里，存着东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x874D2A6ADA8D3536","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1510677017:0":{"text":"It was Master... No, many people, gave me... a heart.","source_cn":"是主人……不，是很多人，给了十六……一颗心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB03E2678C8021BE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1510677018:0":{"text":"I have a heart... Can talk, can... save people. A very bright heart.","source_cn":"十六拥有心……可以说话，可以……救人。很亮的心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68A33B5FCAAA2C57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1510677019:1":{"text":"Master said... it's called \"Hope\".","source_cn":"主人说，那叫“希望”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF81654480751EAD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1510677020:0":{"text":"Sedecim... that light source. <style=\"highlight\">We have to take it out.</style> It's the only way to chase away the darkness... to force the fallen god to show himself. It's the only way we can avenge this town... and free the souls that are still trapped here.","source_cn":"十六……我们必须要<style=highlight>取...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x704A31F54D1EEF96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1510677021:1":{"text":"You might not fully understand, but... without this, Tully and the others will never find peace.","source_cn":"或许你不太明白，但这是将塔利和那些灵魂从苦痛中解放的唯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB4FB2D15398A669","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1510677022:1":{"text":"But once we remove the light... you might never speak again.","source_cn":"只是取出光源后，你可能再也无法行动和说话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95023B2FE2A9BC42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1510677023:0":{"text":"You... you will avenge Master. Right?","source_cn":"你们……会为主人，报仇。对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6405CA19B2796421","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:33:1510677023":{"text":"You... you will avenge Master. Right?","source_cn":"你们……会为主人，报仇。对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6405CA19B2796421","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1510677024:0":{"text":"Okay. Please, take... my heart.","source_cn":"好。请拿走……十六的心。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEA3F616B72F03E3B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Okay. Please, take... my heart.","female":"Okay. Please, take... my heart.","variant_male_record_index":"176451","variant_female_record_index":"176452","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1510677025:0":{"text":"Thank you... Sedecim.","source_cn":"谢谢你……十六。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD6D33B6554E2B83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:37:1510677026:0":{"text":"You use the key to open Sedecim's chest.","source_cn":"你用钥匙打开了十六的胸腔","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89BABFA20E299505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:38:1510677027:0":{"text":"Hidden inside is a diamond-shaped crystal, glowing faintly.","source_cn":"一颗隐隐闪耀着微光的菱形结晶藏于其中","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA40381D06661094","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:39:1510677028:0":{"text":"As the crystal is removed, Sedecim becomes a motionless, silent puppet once more.","source_cn":"随着结晶被取出，十六彻底变回了无法行动和言语的木偶","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEC9EA28BA773B53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1510677029:0":{"text":"... Sedecim?","source_cn":"……十六？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD156AF57CA873A93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1510677030:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog63>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD660CA01633C2BCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1510677031:1":{"text":"I can feel the magic lingering on this crystal.","source_cn":"能感受到晶石上残留的魔力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x966A689835D8B52F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:47::2":{"text":"Light Source","source_cn":"光源","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x114F556187D23632","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1510677032:0":{"text":"It must have taken generations of priests pouring their magic into this, year after year, to make it shine as bright as the sun.","source_cn":"只有数代祭司年累月地赋予它魔力，才能让它放出足以媲美太...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC693D39EB6A8B390","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1510677033:1":{"text":"Perhaps that magic is what gave Sedecim consciousness and the ability to move.","source_cn":"或许是凭借这些魔力，十六才拥有了意识和行动能力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x839AFE761ABAEF3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1510677034:0":{"text":"Even without a soul. What a miracle.","source_cn":"明明没有灵魂。一个奇迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x504B71C3BC83B0A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1510677035:1":{"text":"... Let's return to the Harvest Altar. We'll use Sedecim's final gift to drive out the darkness.","source_cn":"……回丰饶祭坛，用十六的心，驱散黑暗吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EEE6B212D62B7C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1510677036:0":{"text":"Just as Sedecim said, this will be the light of hope.","source_cn":"如同十六所言，这将是希望之光。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8568E3FCBDF5A31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:55:150106514:0":{"text":"Sedecim removes a glittering light source from its chest. As you take it from its hands, its head sinks, and it goes completely still.","source_cn":"十六取出自己的“心”，那是一颗闪闪发亮的晶石光源。你从...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF6CAE92F25AE1211","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Sedecim removes a glitter